 lostorientation.be/activites/weslo-2027\n---------------------------------
 --------------------------------------------------------\nOn April 10th an
 d 11th\, 2027\, the LOST club invites you to a sprint orienteering weekend
  in the beautiful pedestrian-friendly university town of Louvain-la-Neuve.
 \nThis competition is open to everyone: from top-level competitive oriente
 ers to amateur orienteers and complete beginners.\n\nFour activities are o
 n the program: Saturday\, the FRSO sprint championship followed by an indo
 or "Amphi-O" style race\, and Sunday\, a KO Sprint "All Inclusive" or City
  Race for those who do not wish to participate in the KO.  In addition to 
 these competitions\, a sprint training session will be offer
CATEGORIES:Orienteering,Regional
